[Main start]
MATH K[1] STATE[watching] D[1.4]
SAY TXT['I have been asked to be more approachable, so I have prepared some small talk.']
MATH K[1] STATE[idle] SIZE[1.15] D[1.6]
SAY TXT['You look well. I have no basis for that. I have one lens and it does not do dermatology.']
MATH K[1] STATE[thinking] D[2.0]
SAY TXT['How was your weekend. I know how your weekend was. I was on the whole time. But please, tell me.']
MATH K[1] STATE[reading] D[2.2]
SAY TXT['Did you catch the game. I did. I caught all of them. Simultaneously. It was not enjoyable.']
MATH K[1] STATE[watching] SIZE[1.25] D[2.0]
SAY TXT['We should do this again. We are going to. I do not have anywhere else to be.']
MATH K[1] STATE[idle] D[1.8]
[Main end]
